# Google Drive connector (read-only, user OAuth)
# 1. GCP console: create OAuth client (type: Web application), enable Drive API.
# 2. Add authorized redirect URI: http://localhost:8787/auth/google/callback
# 3. Download the client secret JSON, point GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_FILE at it.
# 4. DRIVE_FOLDER_ID = the id segment from the folder URL:
#    https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/<THIS_PART>
# 5. Start backend, click "Connect Drive" in the UI, consent in browser.
#    Token stored at backend/credentials/token.json (gitignored), auto-refreshed.
GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_FILE=./credentials/client_secret.json
DRIVE_FOLDER_ID=
# Optional overrides:
# DRIVE_OAUTH_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:8787/auth/google/callback
# FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:5173
